{
  "name": "Elegant Courtier",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your discipline and attention to detail allow you to excel in social situations. Whenever you make a Charisma (Persuasion) check, you gain a bonus to the check equal to your Wisdom modifier.</p><p>Your self-control also causes you to gain Proficiency in Wisdom Saving Throws. If you already have this Proficiency, you instead gain Proficiency in Intelligence or Charisma Saving Throws (your choice).</p>",
